<title>UK: TABLE-ZENECA H1 PROFIT UP 9.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ZENECA H1 PROFIT UP 9.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		47.3		 vs 43.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 13.5		 vs 12.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     669		  vs 610</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,752		vs 2,940</p>
<p> Research, development  312		  vs 294</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 623 and 670 million stg. Full name of the British pharmaceutical company is Zeneca Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
